# Part 2: System Sequence Diagrams

## SSD 1: Create System Architecture Diagram

This SSD represents the main success scenario for creating elements on the Excalidraw canvas. The user selects a tool, creates and adjusts an element, completes it, and saves the scene.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant S as :ExcalidrawSystem

    User->>S: selectTool(toolType)
    S-->>User: activeTool

    loop for each element
        User->>S: beginElement(toolType, startX, startY)
        User->>S: updateElement(currentX, currentY)
        S-->>User: updatedElementPreview
        User->>S: finishElement(endX, endY)
        S-->>User: completedElement
    end

    User->>S: saveScene()
    S-->>User: sceneSaved
```

