## SSD 2: Export Canvas to PNG Image

This SSD represents the main success scenario for exporting an Excalidraw canvas. The user begins the export process, selects the desired export settings, and exports the finished canvas as a PNG file.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant S as :ExcalidrawSystem

    User->>S: startExport()
    S-->>User: exportPreview

    User->>S: setExportOptions(background, scale, darkMode)
    S-->>User: updatedPreview

    User->>S: exportPNG()
    S-->>User: pngFile
```

---

## SSD 3: Collaborate in Live Room Session

This SSD represents the main success scenario for starting and using a live collaboration session. The user starts a collaboration session, receives a room URL, and then makes changes that are synchronized through the session.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant S as :ExcalidrawSystem

    User->>S: openCollaboration()
    S-->>User: collaborationOptions

    User->>S: startSession()
    S-->>User: roomURL

    User->>S: editElement(elementId, changes)
    S-->>User: synchronizedScene
```

